-- Version 5 to 6 (Phase 3, PR 2b, ADR 0090 item 8): whether the ring this fire started or restarted ran its whole
-- length (`MAX_RING`) unanswered, which is evidence she may not have heard it. 1 on the row of the fire the cap was
-- last restarted by when it expired; 0 on every other row this version writes; null for a row written before this
-- version. A count in the reliability report and the export, with no banner until a device has judged the cap.
ALTER TABLE fire_telemetry ADD COLUMN ring_ended_by_cap INTEGER;
